	I just have to address this point - the E-word only has an effect
when you are standing on that square, so there's little point in using
it for your cache.  Cursed objects only make pets less likely to move
onto the square.  I believe the best way to protect your cache is:

-inside a chest/box/etc. (monsters don't loot containers)

-in a closet with a locked door (most monsters can't break locked doors,
slither under them, phase through them, or teleport in, and many of
those which can can't lift a heavy container anyway)

-with a ton of rocks in the container with it (so anything that does get
to the container probably can't lift it anyway)

I admit that I am probably missing or mis-stating something, though.
There is also the minor issue that closets are not that common
when/where you really want a cache, too, so sometimes you just have to
do what you can.

